; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
; bonded_incident_insult (PR-A-7 V1, 2026-05-28).
;
; First organic insult anchor source. Replaces test_seed_insult's chance-
; primary scaffold once the bonded / public incident family fills out
; (PR-A-10 retires the _test_seed/ directory).
;
; An actor with low politeness and substantial narcissism encounters
; someone they personally know and lets fly a verbal slight. The
; incident-anchor effect:
;   - mints {actor insult victim} in both minds (categorize fires
;     pov=actor pride / pov=patient humiliation via the slight_act
;     reaction row in reactions.ms1);
;   - mints {actor transient_marker recent_incident /aux victim} on
;     actor's mind with a 90-day decay, so the same pair does not
;     re-fire monthly.
;
; Gating shape:
;   - actor: low politeness AND elevated narcissism (substrate-rooted
;     dispositional disposition; the plan's "low politeness x
;     narcissism" multiplied trait product).
;   - victim: personally-knows actor (bonded prerequisite for the
;     "bonded" branch; public incidents will use frequents-overlap)
;     AND the per-pair cooldown has elapsed.
;   - chance dilutes the actor / victim sides as rate jitter on top
;     of the substrate gates - the architectural ground rule allows
;     this AS-LONG-AS substrate predicates do the primary work.
;
; Schedule: monthly. The cooldown marker stops same-pair re-fires
; for 3 months; cross-pair fires continue at the monthly cadence.
; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

(include "../shared/roles.hse")

(hsim-event bonded_incident_insult
  (nl       "?actor insults ?victim")
  (kind     _bonded_incident_insult)
  (schedule (monthly))
  (rng-stream incidents)

  (roles
    (role ?actor  (template any_human)
                  (< (attr ?actor politeness) 0.4)
                  (> (attr ?actor narcissism) 0.5)
                  (chance 0.02))
    (role ?victim (template any_human)
                  (not (= ?victim ?actor))
                  (personally-knows ?actor ?victim)
                  (not (has-recent-incident-marker ?actor ?victim))
                  (chance 0.05)))

  (effects
    (incident-anchor ?actor insult ?victim)
    (log _bonded_incident_insult ?actor)))
